<title>UK: NWE jet fuel prices rocketed higher by futures.</title>
<headline>NWE jet fuel prices rocketed higher by futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel was rocketed higher by stronger futures on Friday, but traders said the firmer prices had choked an already quiet market. Barge premiums were put at Sept IPE +$24/+$27, but no deals were reported.</p>
<p>On the cif cargo market premiums remained around the Sept IPE +$33/+$35 a tonne mark.</p>
<p>&quot;People won't buy unless they have to,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714.</p>
</text>
